#. :src: bpy.types.Driver.use_self
msgid "Use Self"
msgstr "Använd self"

#. :src: bpy.types.Driver.use_self
msgid ""
"Include a 'self' variable in the name-space, so drivers can easily reference "
"the data being modified (object, bone, etc...)"
msgstr ""
"Lägg till variabeln \"self\" i namnrymden så att drivrutiner lätt kan "
"referera till data som ändras (objekt, ben osv.)"

